{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1344307-tc-aberrant-biomanipulation-how-to","id":1344307,"title":"TC: Aberrant Biomanipulation how to","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aberrant"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-10-28T18:00:30-07:00","id":1344307,"title":"TC: Aberrant Biomanipulation how to","content":"So one of my players has always loved biomanipulation. Just wondering if this is a sorry the power will be no where as good as 1e or just house rule some of the effects are permanent on people. Such as using the power as morph on others and having them be permanent with enough successes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6424-fuzzykuma","name":"Fuzzykuma","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6424_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"178"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-28T21:35:25-07:00","id":1344347,"title":"","content":"Well, first you get the power Morph and you can add the tag Impose and you got it, just add duration tags to it to make it Continuous (days) (not Permanent, but... close for game proposes... you could even add one more Duration to make it last for years).<br /> <br /> To make it more flexible you can add techniques to it, maybe molecular manipulation restrict to living beings, elemental mastery for plants, healing, transformation (keeping the impose tag to affect others), plasticity (with impose). The powers are yours to make it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-28T23:53:54-07:00","id":1344358,"title":"","content":"That is a lot of XP to dump for what was once simple.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6424-fuzzykuma","name":"Fuzzykuma","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6424_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"178"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-29T01:14:16-07:00","id":1344361,"title":"","content":"I guess you could power suit it with healing and a few similar powers you can construct from the original.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6424-fuzzykuma","name":"Fuzzykuma","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6424_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"178"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-29T02:56:47-07:00","id":1344366,"title":"","content":"If you keep it lasting for short periods, like maintaining, it will be chipper. But yes, a lot of XP on tags.<br /> <br /> The idea to build any power with multiple effects is power suit a lot of different powers each with its own effects. What once was a level 3 power is now a power suit, and each technique is a power in the suit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-29T03:22:45-07:00","id":1344370,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1344307-tc-aberrant-biomanipulation-how-to?p=1344366#post1344366\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you keep it lasting for short periods, like maintaining, it will be chipper. But yes, a lot of XP on tags.<br /> <br /> The idea to build any power with multiple effects is power suit a lot of different powers each with its own effects. What once was a level 3 power is now a power suit, and each technique is a power in the suit.</div> </div> </div> </div>I understand the change. Just interesting how they are power balancing and pushing the notion of psi templates into the game for Aberrant. I understand the shared universe and all however before with biomanipulation for example you could have a nova doctor that helps with quantum plastic surgery or even go as far as making people anthromorphse or gender swap, Limb regrowth and so on and it was permanent and now it\u2019s practically forbidden in base system. You can get close but what was once a simple power is now a construction zone, 2 SG favors and xp haul away. Though in house rules can be implemented to fix that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6424-fuzzykuma","name":"Fuzzykuma","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6424_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"178"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-29T03:37:48-07:00","id":1344374,"title":"","content":"I think the tag requirements for certain basic things are kinda overkill, at least in the backer draft version. Probably best to just house rule this one for now. I'd base the cost of things like this on how effective they are compared to the more straightforward powers (Mega-Intelligence, Quantum Bolt, etc) instead of a checklist of tags.<br /> <br /> Having a cleaner base system is absolutely great, but some of the powers go a little too far into Mutants &amp; Masterminds / Champions territory of &quot;you have to define every single trick you could possibly do with tags and power suites.&quot; I think the tags system works well for making up new power sets and such, but I kinda wish the classic power suites from the first game had been implemented with built-in techniques and everything and just had a higher cost so that I don't have to make a power called Weather Control and then put a bullet point list to each thing it can do on the character sheet, with each bullet pointed thing being a different power I have to manually stat out. Just being able to put Weather Control and a list of standard tricks would have been better for me. But that's not necessarily a good/bad thing so much as a &quot;this is how I like systems to work, they might disagree&quot; thing.<br /> <br /> I also think maybe having a full 12 XP required to get alternate powers makes sense (or is even too cheap) when those alternate powers are radically different from the base (Quantum Bolt with Heal and Flight as alternates, for instance). But it's way too much for alternate powers that are barely different from the base (slightly different configurations of Quantum Bolt). And I have no idea what the generic Variable tag actually does. But it's kinda unfair for me to complain about that based on a backer draft after the public comments have been closed and they're doing new work. Overall, I imagine the final version will still have the same design decision--it's a valid one, just not my preference in all cases--but maybe have cleaner tags and text.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1711-zeea","name":"Zeea","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"106"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-29T05:26:59-07:00","id":1344390,"title":"","content":"My view on the way power suits work is more about reducing XP power cost in the long run. You start wit a few powers and as you build up your quantum, they multiply for a minimum cost. Tere is no restrictive rules on how you can combine powers in a suit, but your storyguide should aprouve every single one of them, some are pretty straight forward, others may require a better explanation on the way you are thinking.<br /> <br /> One thing some of us didn\u2019t give much attention is the power stunts. It\u2019s a great way to turn a power in a Swiss Army knife.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-29T09:00:04-07:00","id":1344427,"title":"","content":"Iirc one of the guys of divis mal\u2019s circle has bio-manipulation powers, and one of the stretch goal of the Kickstarter was a compendium of novas, you could see in it haw they handle it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5811-starkiller","name":"Starkiller","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-29T09:18:38-07:00","id":1344433,"title":"","content":"You're referring to Dr. Altaz &quot;Apothecary&quot; Zia? Hopefully he makes it into the compendium which we're probably going to need for examples of proper power suite builds. I think there was talk of making Sin Eater's (I think she's been renamed to &quot;Dalit&quot;) taint control power into an expression of biomanipulation as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/765-darksol-aeternium","name":"Darksol-aeternium","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar765_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"392"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-29T22:03:13-07:00","id":1344579,"title":"","content":"I know in 1e I would allow biomanipulation to give people, base lines that is, stats as stated in the power as well as body mods, the first dot in mega stats, some enhancements and powers. All based on knowable today science. <br /> For instance, giving a human a single dot in Mega-Strength. Humans have built in limiters decreasing or ability to use muscle as it can be damaging. Fly and ant muscles are many times more capable then human muscle is. However giving a human fly muscles would cause them to shred themselves and rip themselves apart from the inside. Unless you also added in aspects of the octopus. Fun fact, there beak is the hardness known organic biological structure, however where the beak enters the body and connects to the rest of the organism is as soft and supple as leather. So if you incorporated ant muscles and reinforced the tendency with a similar organic nature fallowed by re engendering the bones, say built in carbon nanotubes interlacing through the structure the frame could support much greater use of musculature. <br /> So if you delve into science there is so many amazing things that can be explained the could be much more easily a polished with quantum powers. Let alone just causing someone\u2019s hair to grow or to change color. Now I know the new TC line is outing in a lot more effort toward the psi template aspect, however for my group that\u2019s an easy hand way away. Also, any changes made with biomanipulation causes the players, if human at the time, to gain an XP deficient then need to pay off at 1/2 of all XP gained is auto spent till its paid off. <br /> Some of the powers in this game start at medium range for area or scale +1 so for me I know I will just make a morph specific tag or hat let\u2019s cosmetic features be made permanent and any game stats such as alternate identities or what not be XP needed to be paid off.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6424-fuzzykuma","name":"Fuzzykuma","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6424_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"178"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-29T22:11:43-07:00","id":1344581,"title":"","content":"(needs more paragraphs)<br /> <br /> The strength-to-mass ratio of a fly isn't due to the composition of the fly's muscles; it's because of the square-cube law: indeed, the reason why the fly's legs are so spindly is because they don't need to be very thick to support the fly's weight. Shrink a human down to the size of a fly, and the human's much thicker muscles would outperform the fly in a big way.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":421,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","user":"Dataweaver","date":". 10-30-2019, 01:18 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-29T22:33:50-07:00","id":1344587,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1344307-tc-aberrant-biomanipulation-how-to?p=1344581#post1344581\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(needs more paragraphs)<br /> <br /> The strength-to-mass ratio of a fly isn't due to the composition of the fly's muscles; it's because of the square-cube law: indeed, the reason why the fly's legs are so spindly is because they don't need to be very thick to support the fly's weight. Shrink a human down to the size of a fly, and the human's much thicker muscles would outperform the fly in a big way.</div> </div> </div> </div>I do stand corrected in ant muscles.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6424-fuzzykuma","name":"Fuzzykuma","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6424_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"178"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-30T01:12:30-07:00","id":1344602,"title":"","content":"Work around is to utilize stronger connective tissues, bone and muscle and remove limited to allow people to generally access what would be called hysterical strength.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6424-fuzzykuma","name":"Fuzzykuma","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6424_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"178"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-30T10:56:28-07:00","id":1344697,"title":"","content":"I don't see where Novas were cheapened to benefit Psions here. You would need two high powered Psions to permanently alter someone else, a Vitakinetic and a Biokinetic working together, and you'd need a third to do it without touching.<br /> <br /> Nova just uses Morph with Impose.<br /> <br /> I think this might have been a change to reign in some of the powers from 1e, as easy access to that kind of power warps the setting a little.<br /> <br /> I was looking into this same kind of power theme when trying to recreate \u00c6on era Aberrants when they create sub-Aberrant mutants. In the fiction it is usually only the higher powered Aberrants that are actively making sub-aberrant mutants on purpose (not just having them produced by radiated Corruption), so it could very well be as simple as popping an Impose tag on a high Quantum power suite. I'd almost like to tag the same caveat that the Heal power has for Impose, where if you are putting too many points of power into a baseline they get some Transcendence and Transformations.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksha are my fae-vorite.<br /> <br /> Reincarnation of magnificentmomo.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1542-morosemorgan","name":"MoroseMorgan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1542_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"778"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-30T11:42:00-07:00","id":1344705,"title":"","content":"My view on the SubAberrant producing power is not the creation but the control. Just give a Heal power to a transcendent Aberrant and you the sun Aberrants will pop really fast.<br /> <br /> Controlling them is more an issue in the distance and all, probably would use a Mega Manipulation to brain wash a and command them (not controlling directly them) and maybe the mega edge to use it at range with the transmission power.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-30T14:44:13-07:00","id":1344753,"title":"","content":"Also, I double checked, and Psions can't ever change someone else's noetic template at range. All VK powers require touch, and those are the powers that when combined with BK give people crazy changes. Impose tag just requires the target be in Close Range. I'd argue that purchases of the Ranged tag could apply.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksha are my fae-vorite.<br /> <br /> Reincarnation of magnificentmomo.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1542-morosemorgan","name":"MoroseMorgan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1542_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"778"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-30T18:32:59-07:00","id":1344792,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MoroseMorgan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1344307-tc-aberrant-biomanipulation-how-to?p=1344753#post1344753\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, I double checked, and Psions can't ever change someone else's noetic template at range. All VK powers require touch, and those are the powers that when combined with BK give people crazy changes. Impose tag just requires the target be in Close Range. I'd argue that purchases of the Ranged tag could apply.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sure it can, that\u2019s the idea around the tag system, just add as needed to get the desired effect.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-30T23:27:23-07:00","id":1344845,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MoroseMorgan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1344307-tc-aberrant-biomanipulation-how-to?p=1344753#post1344753\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, I double checked, and Psions can't ever change someone else's noetic template at range. All VK powers require touch, and those are the powers that when combined with BK give people crazy changes. Impose tag just requires the target be in Close Range. I'd argue that purchases of the Ranged tag could apply.</div> </div> </div> </div>You\u2019d need to link your BK and VK with a clairsentient to get range. (Or a teleporter for area effect, but that get\u2019s costly with multiple people in the area.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-31T03:28:02-07:00","id":1344881,"title":"","content":"I wonder for SubAberrant mutants if you could also create a tag for Quantum Agent and instead of creating you instill into others the Quantum Agent in a power investing way you could take back if they displease you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6424-fuzzykuma","name":"Fuzzykuma","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6424_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"178"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-31T07:58:18-07:00","id":1344941,"title":"","content":"My approach on sub-Aberrants is once they start getting transformations they also can learn Superior Powers, no more dots in those than transformations. So a Flux 5 would have 2 transformations and 2 dots of superior powers. If they get to Flux 10, they die, as their body can\u2019t handle the flux.<br /> <br /> When it happen, a Nova with Telecommunication can use the power on them automatically, and using Mega Manipulation, Mass-Influence and Telepresence they can control lots of Sub-Aberrants. As they get more transformations they also can get psychological transformations and get more violent, so all the nova need to do is to control them until they are near the target, and them release them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":